build*
secret

# Everything under subprojects/ EXCEPT the two things meson genuinely needs in
# the image: the wrap files and the packagefiles overlays. The extracted trees
# and the tarball cache are re-materialised inside the build from the wraps, so
# shipping the host's copies only inflates the context.
#
# `subprojects/*` matches the children individually rather than the directory,
# which is what makes the `!` re-inclusions below take effect.
#
# DE-VERSIONED DELIBERATELY. This file used to name subprojects/DPP-10.1.3 and
# subprojects/magic_enum-0.9.7. Both had been superseded, so the trees actually
# on disk were not excluded at all and the list was decorative. Renovate now
# bumps these versions by itself, which would have re-broken any pinned
# spelling on every PR it opens.
subprojects/*
!subprojects/*.wrap
!subprojects/packagefiles
